answer:
`pkgs.formats.hocon` validates generated HOCON using `pyhocon` by default. Since `pyhocon` does not implement classpath includes, validation fails when using them.

Use either:

```nix
pkgs.formats.hocon {
  doCheck = false;
}
```

or provide an alternative validator:

```nix
pkgs.formats.hocon {
  validator = alternativeValidator;
}
```

The format documentation explicitly recommends one of these approaches for classpath includes. A related nixpkgs issue also reports that the `type = "classpath"` generator was broken and that its validator failed to parse the result. ([documentation](https://docharvest.github.io/docs/nixos/development/settings-options.section/), [issue #329448](https://github.com/NixOS/nixpkgs/issues/329448))
